# Named Cloudflare tunnel for the UAI gateway.
#
# Fill both lines in, then run:  ./start-gateway.sh --named
#
# 1. Cloudflare dashboard -> Zero Trust -> Networks -> Tunnels -> Create a tunnel
#    -> Cloudflared -> name it (for example "uai-gateway").
# 2. Copy the token it shows you into TOKEN below.
# 3. On that tunnel's Public Hostname tab add:
#       Subdomain: uai          Domain: <your domain>
#       Service:   HTTP  ->  http://127.0.0.1:8792
#    and put the full hostname in HOSTNAME below.
#
# The hostname is permanent, so endpoint.txt stops changing and the Android loader
# never needs a fresh URL. Without this file the script keeps using a quick tunnel
# and republishes endpoint.txt whenever the random hostname rotates.
TOKEN=
HOSTNAME=
